              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Steven Moshlak"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Followed the recipe almost, with the exception of the apple cider vinegar. thought I had it, but substituted red wine vinegar, instead.\n\nOMG. I normally have made lamb, in the oven. This is the best lamb recipe I have used and it came out PERFECT. Wasn't the least bit oily or greasy. The meat was flavorful and the marinade &amp; BBQ took the \"weird taste\" and odor, I have had with lamb. With the 10 minute wait, to let it rest. I was preparing additional vegetables, in parallel and everything came together in the end."
          },
