            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm Greek, this is the best rack I've EVER had. I only had one rack for the recipe, so I made 1/2 the marinade &amp; kept the rack in it for about 2 hours.\nI shorted the ketchup to about 1/3 cup because the thought of it on my lamb was too disturbing.\nI will absolutely use this again &amp; my Very Greek Mother can't wait for Easter!",
